The program is a very simple kind of game and I had a lot of fun with the sliders. 
The "goal" is to find the correct colors to turn the triangle. 
If you get one, a circle colors with the corrosponding color. 
Once all the circles are colored, you win. 
The three colors are just the three extremes of the rgb scale.

Also a warning: I started coding this and wound up with half my functions named
using German. I'll avoid this in the future. 
Anyway, here is a handy key for non-german speakers.
"drawDreiEck" --> "drawTriang"
"drawKreis" --> "drawCircle"
"Ecke" --> "Corner"

